---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { SITE } from '../data/site.js';
---
<Base title="Terms of use" description="Terms for using silitlabs.com, the licence for Silit Labs clinic kits and the terms of the AI Visibility Report.">
  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="wrap">
      <ol class="crumbs"><li><a href="/">Home</a></li><li aria-current="page">Terms</li></ol>
      <h1>Terms of use</h1>
      <p class="muted" style="margin-top:14px">Last updated 23 November 2026</p>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="section tight">
    <div class="wrap article">
      <p>These terms cover silitlabs.com and the digital products we sell. Flowdeck and AI SEO Deck have their own terms of service (<a href="https://flowdeck.silitlabs.com/terms">Flowdeck</a>, <a href="https://aiseodeck.silitlabs.com/terms">AI SEO Deck</a>). Purchases on Etsy are also subject to Etsy's terms.</p>
      <h2>Clinic kit licence</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>One licence covers one clinic brand, including all of its locations.</li>
        <li>You may edit, print and share the documents with your own patients, in print or digitally.</li>
        <li>You may not resell, share or give away the files or templates, alone or as part of another product.</li>
        <li>Agencies and groups with several brands need one licence per brand. Write to us for multi-brand terms.</li>
      </ul>
      <h2>Templates are not advice</h2>
      <p>Consent forms, health questionnaires, policies and aftercare texts are professional templates written from published clinical guidance. They are not legal or medical advice. Before using them, have them reviewed by your responsible clinicians and a legal advisor, and adapt them to the law in your country, including data protection rules.</p>
      <h2>Digital delivery and refunds</h2>
      <p>Kits are digital downloads delivered right after payment. If a file does not open or something is missing, write to us and we will fix it or send a working copy. Refunds follow the rules of the platform you bought on.</p>
      <h2>Setup service</h2>
      <p>When we brand a kit for you, you confirm that you have the right to use the logos, photos and texts you send us. Delivery times and the number of revision rounds are stated when you order.</p>
      <h2 id="ai-visibility-report">AI Visibility Report</h2>
      <p>The AI Visibility Report works for any website and needs no account. It reads the public pages of the website you enter and asks AI assistants about it. The free check is free. The full report is a single payment, billed by Polar, our merchant of record. It is built for your website as soon as you pay and is delivered as a web page at a private address, which we also email to you if you give us an address. One re-check, about 30 days later, is part of it.</p>
      <p>Every sale of the report is final. It is made for you at once, so there are no refunds after payment. If a report cannot be built, we build it again at no charge. Nothing here limits a right the law gives you that cannot be waived.</p>
      <p>The address of a report is its key: anyone who has it can open the report, so share it only with people who should read it. Drafts in the fix kit are written by an AI model from the words on your own site. Read them before you publish them. A paid report is kept for 400 days.</p>
      <h2>Liability</h2>
      <p>We make the products with care but provide them as they are. To the extent the law allows, Silit Labs is not liable for indirect losses arising from their use, and our total liability is limited to the amount you paid for the product.</p>
      <h2>Law</h2>
      <p>These terms are governed by Turkish law. Questions: <a href={`mailto:${SITE.email}`}>{SITE.email}</a>.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
